  <releases>
    <release date="2026-09-28" version="3.12.4">
      <description>
        <p>Bugs fixed and enhancements:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Remove libegg multidrag treeview support for in-built 'GtkFileChooser' (sid)</li>
          <li>cdrkit: Add better error message for "Unsupported sector size" errors (sid)</li>
          <li>cdrdao: Add better error message for "Unsupported track mode" errors (sid)</li>
          <li>libbrasero-burn: Fix incorrect condition during error check (sid)</li>
          <li>Replace 'BaobabCellRendererProgress' with native 'GtkCellRendererProgress' (sid)</li>
          <li>Fix grammar in help (Anders Jonsson)</li>
          <li>Update confirmation dialog logic to properly trigger cancellation dialog (John Cardullo)</li>
          <li>burn-dialog: Use 'media-optical' for notifications (sid)</li>
          <li>Prefer 'application/vnd.efi.iso' MIME type (sid)</li>
          <li>src: Fix 'GtkSpinButton' filling vertical space (sid)</li>
          <li>libbrasero-burn: Fix incorrect plugin version comparison (sid)</li>
          <li>checksum: Default to SHA256 rather than MD5 (David King)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Updated translations for: Abkhazian, Basque, Catalan, Chinese (China), Danish, French, Friulian, Georgian, German, Icelandic, Indonesian, Interlingue, Karbi, Kazakh, Nepali, Occitan, Portuguese, Russian, Slovenian, Spanish, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Uzbek (Latin).</p>
      </description>
    </release>
    <release date="2021-09-20" version="3.12.3">
      <description>
        <p>This release includes the following changes:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Blu-ray fixes (Bastien Nocera)</li>
          <li>Support Tracker 3.0 (Carlos Garnacho)</li>
          <li>Add CI (Bastien Nocera)</li>
          <li>Transcode plugin gstreamer plugin improvement (Robert McQueen)</li>
          <li>Fix crash with malformed URI (Geyslan)</li>
          <li>Fix default project label (Pimm "de Chinchilla" Hogeling)</li>
          <li>Man page fixes (Ville Skyttä)</li>
          <li>Header guard fix (Ting-Wei Lan)</li>
          <li>Help improvements (scootergrisen, Andre Klapper)</li>
          <li>Translation updates</li>
        </ul>
      </description>
    </release>
